    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's helpful, thanks. Could you expand a bit more on the enzymatic part of the process? Specifically, which enzymes are involved in the initial breakdown and how does the rupture of the onion cells trigger the reaction? I want to make sure I can explain the mechanism step-by-step for the students.",
